eps { sh '''..''' / sh(script: \\\"..\\\", returnStdout: true) / bat '..' / powershell '..' / pwsh '..' / script { .. } } }`, `node('label') {}`, `agent { label 'x' } / docker { image 'x' }`), GitHub Actions YAML (`jobs.<id>.runs-on`, `steps[].run` block scalars `|`/`>` with `shell: bash|pwsh|python|cmd`, `uses: actions/github-script` `script:`), GitLab CI (`script:`/`before_script:` lists, `image:`, `tags:`), Azure Pipelines (`- script:` `- bash:` `- powershell:` `- pwsh:`), CircleCI `run: command:`, Bitbucket `script:`, Drone `commands:`. Unescape Groovy '''/\\\"\\\"\\\"/GString `${}` and YAML block/flow scalars (reuse lib.codec _yaml_* + inner_scripts), map shell->lang (sh/bash->bash, bat/cmd->batch, powershell/pwsh->powershell, python->python, node/github-script->node) and run v3_plan/find_codecs on every body. Gate: D20 jenkins host + synthetic Jenkinsfile/GHA/GitLab fixtures wrapping D1-D20 plans in each step kind; D1-D20 members unchanged.\"},\n215\t  {\"id\": \"prior-language-host-battery\", \"concept\": \"host files that wrap an OLD language (D20 classic_asp VBScript): ASP JScript, WSC, Jupyter Python, systemd/cron Bash, Electron Node, NSE Lua, GPO/task-XML PowerShell\", \"priority\": 1, \"action\": \"prebuild\", \"detail\": \"D20 shipped `host-classic-asp-vbscript.vbs` (`<%@ Language=VBScript %>` + `<% ' HUNTRESS_ANALYSIS_V1:B64-.. %>` + `Dim descriptor_<id>` / assignment on the next line) -- the first host for a prior language. Build a fixture battery + reader check for likely siblings, each wrapping a D1-D20 plan: classic ASP `<script language=\\\"JScript\\\" runat=\\\"server\\\">` and `<%@ Language=JScript %>`; Windows Script Component `.wsc` (`<component><registration progid=..><script language=\\\"VBScript\\\"><![CDATA[..]]>`); systemd unit `ExecStart=/bin/bash -c '..'` + `# marker`; crontab line `* * * * * bash -c \\\"..\\\"`; `.desktop` `Exec=sh -c`; Electron `package.json` `main` + `preload.js`; Nmap NSE `.nse` (`description = [[..]]`, `--` marker)